139 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 118 0 R
/E (Survival prognosis is integral to personalized oncology. We present a multimodal deep learning model that leverages unsupervised representation learning and an attention-based fusion layer to extract and weight salient signals across clinical, mRNA, miRNA, and CNV data. Trained on TCGA pancancer cohorts \(6,656 train\), the model reaches training C-index up to 0.928 and shows improved prediction across most cancer types. Our approach demonstrates that deep representational learning with attention can synthesize complex multi-omic inputs toward clinically useful risk scores.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
